1/jour — offre 1 &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Souhait.html&quot; title=&quot;Souhait&quot;&gt;souhait&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; (&#224; des morts uniquement), &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Qu&#234;te.html&quot; title=&quot;Qu&#234;te&quot;&gt;qu&#234;te&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Convocation-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Convocation (Mag)&quot;&gt;convocation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; (niveau 5, 2 &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Diable-Osseux.html&quot; title=&quot;Diable, Diable osseux (Osyluth)&quot;&gt;diables osseux&lt;/a&gt; 75%)
